## Why excluded

Three independent web searches (`"neomorph" AI model LLM`, `"Neomorph" LLM model AI lab`, `neomorph model huggingface / "large language model"`) returned **no verifiable public model** named "Neomorph". Results were noise only:

- "Neo Lab" / "NEO Lab" — a *category* of AI lab (small founder-led research labs), not a model.
- Biological "neomorph" (a mode-of-action term in genetics / protein-variant literature).
- NVIDIA NeMo framework docs (unrelated acronym collision: NeMo ≠ Neomorph).

No provider, model card, benchmark, pricing, or architecture for a "Neomorph" LLM could be found. Per the self-exclusion rule, zero verified public benchmarks → save as `.md.excluded`, no fabricated scores.

